  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationella Kvinnof&#xf6;rbundet f&#xf6;r Fred och Frihet - Regionalt MENA-projekt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s International League for Peace and Freedom (WILPF) MENA Project - Women&apos;s International League for Peace and Freedom MENA Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r att bidra till att st&#xf6;dja lokala kvinnoledda organisationer och feministiska r&#xf6;relser f&#xf6;r fred i MENA-regionen s&#xe5; att de kan utveckla sina egna agendor, narrativ och perspektiv och kr&#xe4;va utrymme i beslutsfattande p&#xe5; lokal, nationell och internationell niv&#xe5;, vilket sedermera f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra till en inkluderande, intersektionell och inflytelserik fredsr&#xf6;relse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to support local women-led organizations and feminist peace movements in the MENA region to develop their own agendas, narratives and perspectives and to claim spaces within decision-making at the local, national and international levels, to contribute to an inclusive, intersectional and powerful peace movement.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to support local women-led organizations and feminist peace movements in the MENA region to develop their own agendas, narratives and perspectives and to claim spaces within decision-making at the local, national and international levels, to contribute to an inclusive, intersectional and powerful peace movement.</narrative>
  </description>
